/**************************************************태블릿 상단 메뉴**************************************************/
/*2023-02-14 신정수*/
/*홈버튼*/
#openedTabHome {
    z-index:3;
    width: 70px;
}
#openedTabHome_back{
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    background: #F3F3F3;
}
/*홈버튼 집모양 크기조절*/
.fa-home:before {
    font-size: 30px;
}

.main_right_tabmenu .wj-tabheaders {
    background-color: transparent;
    overflow: auto !important;
    overflow-y: auto !important;
    height: 70px;
    width: 950px;
}

/* 우측 admin영역 */
.main_right_adminmenu {
    position: absolute;
    right: 10px;
    /*padding-top: 15px;*/
    cursor: pointer;
    height: 70px;
}
.main_right_adminmenu > .fullScreen {
    width: 110px;
    height: 70px;
    display: inline-grid;
    align-content: center;
}

.main_right_adminmenu > .fullScreen span {
    margin-left: 18px;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    font-family: Roboto;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 20px;
    line-height: 35.16px;
}

.main_right_adminmenu > .windowScreen {
